  "sentences": [
    {"text": "A long, jagged scar ran from his temple to his jaw.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "A livid, purple bruise spread across her cheekbone.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The fresh, raw graze stung in the cold air.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A deep, ragged gash split his eyebrow.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "A thin, silvery line crossed the bridge of his nose.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "His swollen, blackened eye had closed to a slit.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "A faint, crescent-shaped mark curved beneath her lip.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Puckered, twisted scar tissue tugged at the corner of his mouth, so that he always seemed about to sneer.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "A dark, crusted scab had formed over the cut.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A bright thread of blood trickled down his chin.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The old, faded scars on his face told their own story.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "His split, swollen lip throbbed with every heartbeat.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "She winced as she touched it.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "By the end of the week the ugly, mottled swelling had faded to yellow.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A shiny, puckered burn marred the left side of his face.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "To everyone's surprise, the cut healed without a mark.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "A neat row of stitches held the wound closed.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Raw, angry welts rose across his cheek where the branch had whipped him.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "The claws had slashed him from ear to chin.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "He came out of the fight with a torn ear and a grin.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "He kept his collar turned up and his scarred cheek to the wall.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "She had stopped noticing the mark years ago; only strangers stared.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "His lip swelled, and blood oozed between his teeth.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The scar was white against his tan, like a crack in a wall.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The boy wore his black eye like a medal.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "\"You should see the other fellow,\" he said, and the bandage shifted as he laughed.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "She dabbed the scratch with warm water, talking softly all the while.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "The graze bled a little and then stopped.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "He flinched when the cloth touched his jaw.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The wound was shallow, but it would leave a scar.", "vibe": "General"}
  ]
